# Finance Dashboard — project context

Behavioral rules (including commit-after-chunk): [golden-rule.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/golden-rule.mdc). Agent index: [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md). Deep docs: `docs/` (on-demand, not duplicated here).

## Layout

- `backend/` — Express + Prisma + SQLite (`prisma/schema.prisma`, `src/app.ts`, `src/auth.ts`, `src/routes/`, `test/` for HTTP/integration)
- `frontend/` — Vite + React + TypeScript (`src/components/`, `src/pages/`, `src/api/`, `src/state/`)
- Repository root: `npm run dev`, `npm run build`
- Product backlog: `mvp/` (not the same as shipped code)

## Local dev

- Root: `npm run dev` (backend `:4000`, frontend `:5173`). Setup, env, seed: [README.md](mdc:README.md). Tests: `npm test`; coverage and checklist: [docs/reference/testing.md](mdc:docs/reference/testing.md), [docs/how-to/run-tests-and-coverage.md](mdc:docs/how-to/run-tests-and-coverage.md). Docs hub: [docs/README.md](mdc:docs/README.md).

## Conventions

- **LF only** — [line-endings.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/line-endings.mdc), `.editorconfig`, `.gitattributes`.
- Minimal diff (golden-rule). New routes in `backend/src/routes/*` (wire in `mountRouters.ts`); API clients in `frontend/src/api/`; UI in `frontend/src/components/` or `pages/`.
- Schema changes: `cd backend && npx prisma migrate dev --name <description>` — see [README.md](mdc:README.md) for reset notes.
